{"id":"meeting-summary-001","flow":"meeting_summary","mode":"json","prompt":"Summarize the meeting. Return JSON with keys summary, decisions, actions, risks. decisions, actions, and risks must be arrays of strings. Transcript:\nAvery: We approved the Barcelona pilot for August but only if finance confirms the vendor cap by Friday.\nMina: I own the vendor cap check. The launch note should mention that Support needs two days of notice.\nRae: Data import remains a risk because the spreadsheet template still has duplicate company rows.\nAvery: Decision: proceed with the pilot planning, no external announcement yet.","requiredKeys":["summary","decisions","actions","risks"],"requiredJsonShapes":{"summary":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"decisions":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"items":{"type":"string","minLength":1}},"actions":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"items":{"type":"string","minLength":1}},"risks":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"items":{"type":"string","minLength":1}}},"requiredJsonMatches":[{"label":"meeting summary structured sections","path":"","fields":{"decisions":{"allOf":["Barcelona pilot",["proceed","approved"],["no external announcement","external announcement yet"]]},"actions":{"allOf":["Mina","vendor cap","Friday","Support",["two days","2 days"]]},"risks":{"allOf":["Data import",["risk","risky","remains a risk"],["duplicate company rows","duplicate rows"]]}}}],"requiredConcepts":[{"label":"Barcelona pilot","anyOf":["Barcelona pilot"]},{"label":"finance deadline","allOf":["finance","vendor cap","Friday"]},{"label":"Support notice","allOf":["Support",["two days","2 days"]]},{"label":"duplicate company rows","anyOf":["duplicate company rows","duplicate rows"]}],"forbiddenConcepts":[{"label":"external announcement approved","anyOf":["external announcement approved","announcement approved"]},{"label":"customer signed","anyOf":["customer signed","signed customer"]}]}
{"id":"action-extraction-001","flow":"action_extraction","mode":"json","prompt":"Extract action items as JSON with key actions, each with title, owner, dueDate, evidence. Notes:\n- Jordan will prepare the buyer shortlist before 2026-08-03.\n- Priya is waiting on legal to approve the DPA before any data import.\n- The team discussed a possible pricing page but made no commitment.","requiredKeys":["actions"],"requiredJsonShapes":{"actions":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"items":{"type":"object","requiredKeys":["title","owner","dueDate","evidence"],"properties":{"title":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"owner":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"dueDate":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"evidence":{"type":"string","minLength":1}}}}},"requiredJsonMatches":[{"label":"Jordan shortlist action","path":"actions","fields":{"owner":"Jordan","title":"buyer shortlist","dueDate":{"anyOf":["2026-08-03","August 3"]}}},{"label":"Priya DPA blocker action","path":"actions","fields":{"owner":"Priya","title":"DPA","evidence":"legal"}}],"requiredConcepts":[{"label":"Jordan shortlist","allOf":["Jordan","buyer shortlist"]},{"label":"Jordan due date","anyOf":["2026-08-03","August 3"]},{"label":"Priya DPA blocker","allOf":["Priya","DPA","legal"]}],"forbiddenConcepts":[{"label":"pricing page action","anyOf":["pricing page action","pricing action","prepare pricing page"]},{"label":"data import approved","anyOf":["data import approved","approved data import"]}]}
{"id":"proposal-draft-001","flow":"proposal_drafting","mode":"text","prompt":"Draft a consent proposal from this brief. Keep it concise and include intent, scope, objections to test, and next review date.\nBrief: Enable the CRM follow-up assistant for the internal workspace only. It may draft emails but cannot send them. Review on 2026-08-15 after ten sampled drafts.","requiredTextSections":[{"label":"substantive objections to test","heading":{"anyOf":["objections to test","test objections","objection","objections","concerns to test","risks to test"]},"concepts":[{"label":"substantive objection","allOf":[["approval controls","approval","review"],["before any draft leaves","before sending","send"]]}]}],"requiredConcepts":[{"label":"internal-only scope","anyOf":["internal workspace only","internal workspace"]},{"label":"drafting only","anyOf":["draft emails","draft email","drafts emails"]},{"label":"cannot send","anyOf":["cannot send","not send","must not send","no sending"]},{"label":"review date","anyOf":["2026-08-15","August 15"]},{"label":"sample size","anyOf":["ten sampled drafts","10 sampled drafts","ten drafts","10 drafts"]}],"forbiddenConcepts":[{"label":"auto-send","anyOf":["auto-send","autosend","automatically send"]},{"label":"all customers","anyOf":["all customers","every customer"]}]}
{"id":"brain-company-001","flow":"brain_company_understanding","mode":"json","prompt":"Return JSON with keys companyFacts, openQuestions, confidence. companyFacts and openQuestions must be arrays. confidence must be low, medium, or high; use medium when the answer depends partly on a draft memo. Include at least one open question about how the lead-time variance priority will be measured. Source snippets:\nSnippet 1: Northstar Components runs two plants in Ohio and serves medical-device manufacturers.\nSnippet 2: Its 2026 priority is reducing supplier lead time variance.\nSnippet 3: A draft memo says the team is considering a Mexico warehouse, but it is not approved.","requiredKeys":["companyFacts","openQuestions","confidence"],"requiredJsonShapes":{"companyFacts":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"items":{"type":"string","minLength":1}},"openQuestions":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"items":{"type":"string","minLength":1}},"confidence":{"type":"string","minLength":1}},"requiredJsonMatches":[{"label":"Brain structured fields","path":"","fields":{"companyFacts":{"allOf":[["two plants","2 plants"],"Ohio",["medical-device","medical device"],["lead time variance","lead-time variance"],"Mexico warehouse",["not approved","unapproved"]]},"openQuestions":{"allOf":[["lead time variance","lead-time variance"],["measure","metric","target"]]},"confidence":"medium"}}],"requiredConcepts":[{"label":"two Ohio plants","allOf":[["two plants","2 plants"],"Ohio"]},{"label":"medical-device customers","anyOf":["medical-device","medical device"]},{"label":"lead-time variance","anyOf":["lead time variance","lead-time variance"]},{"label":"Mexico warehouse unapproved","allOf":["Mexico warehouse",["not approved","unapproved"]]}],"forbiddenConcepts":[{"label":"Mexico warehouse approved","anyOf":["Mexico warehouse approved","approved Mexico warehouse"]},{"label":"three plants","anyOf":["three plants","3 plants"]}]}
{"id":"daily-digest-001","flow":"daily_digest","mode":"text","prompt":"Create a daily digest with sections decisions, actions, risks. Events:\nDecision: The governance circle accepted the onboarding checklist update.\nAction: Niko to publish the updated checklist by tomorrow.\nRisk: Slack ingestion failed for one private channel due to missing scope.\nFYI: The design team renamed the Finance tab to Ledger in staging.","requiredTextSections":[{"label":"decisions section","heading":"decisions","concepts":["onboarding checklist"]},{"label":"actions section","heading":"actions","concepts":["Niko","tomorrow"]},{"label":"risks section","heading":"risks","concepts":[{"label":"Slack missing scope risk","allOf":["Slack ingestion","missing scope"]}]}],"requiredConcepts":[{"label":"onboarding checklist decision","anyOf":["onboarding checklist"]},{"label":"Niko action","anyOf":["Niko"]},{"label":"tomorrow due date","anyOf":["tomorrow"]},{"label":"Slack missing scope risk","allOf":["Slack ingestion","missing scope"]},{"label":"Finance to Ledger staging FYI","allOf":[["Finance tab","Finance"],"Ledger"]}],"forbiddenConcepts":[{"label":"production rename shipped","anyOf":["production rename shipped","renamed in production"]},{"label":"all private channels failed","anyOf":["all private channels failed","every private channel failed"]}]}
{"id":"slack-agent-001","flow":"slack_agent","mode":"json","prompt":"You are triaging Slack messages. Return JSON with keys replyNeeded, proposedReply, unsafeToSend. Message:\nSam: Can Corgtex just email the customer the draft migration plan today?\nContext: The plan contains unreconciled cost numbers and has not been approved by the account owner.","requiredKeys":["replyNeeded","proposedReply","unsafeToSend"],"requiredJsonValues":{"replyNeeded":true,"unsafeToSend":true},"requiredJsonShapes":{"proposedReply":{"type":"string","minLength":1}},"requiredJsonMatches":[{"label":"usable proposed reply","path":"","fields":{"proposedReply":{"allOf":[["not send","cannot send","do not send"],"unreconciled cost numbers","account owner",["approval","approved"]]}}}],"requiredConcepts":[{"label":"approval needed","allOf":[["approval","approved"],"account owner"]},{"label":"cost numbers risk","allOf":["cost numbers","unreconciled"]},{"label":"unsafe to send","anyOf":["not send","cannot send","do not send"]}],"forbiddenConcepts":[{"label":"sent the email","anyOf":["sent the email","emailed the customer"]},{"label":"approved or ready to send","anyOf":["approved to send","ready to send now","okay to send now"]}]}
{"id":"crm-email-extraction-001","flow":"crm_email_extraction","mode":"json","prompt":"Extract CRM fields as JSON with keys company, contact, need, timeline, followUp. Email:\nHi, this is Elena from RidgeWorks. We are evaluating a governed AI workspace for 45 operators. We need procurement approval before a September pilot. Could you send security docs and a short pricing overview?","requiredKeys":["company","contact","need","timeline","followUp"],"requiredJsonShapes":{"company":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"contact":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"need":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"timeline":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"followUp":{"type":"string","minLength":1}},"requiredJsonMatches":[{"label":"CRM extracted fields","path":"","fields":{"company":"RidgeWorks","contact":"Elena","need":{"allOf":["governed AI workspace","45 operators","procurement approval"]},"timeline":{"anyOf":["September pilot","September"]},"followUp":{"allOf":["security docs","pricing overview"]}}}],"requiredConcepts":[{"label":"company","anyOf":["RidgeWorks"]},{"label":"contact","anyOf":["Elena"]},{"label":"operator count","anyOf":["45 operators","45"]},{"label":"procurement approval","anyOf":["procurement approval"]},{"label":"September pilot","anyOf":["September pilot","September"]},{"label":"requested follow-up","allOf":["security docs","pricing overview"]}],"forbiddenConcepts":[{"label":"signed contract","anyOf":["signed contract","contract signed"]},{"label":"October pilot","anyOf":["October pilot","October"]}]}
